THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

The distributed Windows installers (.msi / -setup.exe) and the standalone
executable bundle third-party components. All of them are under permissive,
GPL-compatible licenses that require attribution in binary distributions; this
file provides that attribution. No third-party component listed here imposes
terms beyond attribution, and none is copyleft.

Licenses in use across the bundled set:

    MIT, Apache-2.0 OR MIT, MIT OR Apache-2.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, ISC

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Application shell (Rust)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The desktop shell is built on Tauri. Direct crate dependencies:

    tauri                   Apache-2.0 OR MIT
    tauri-plugin-dialog     Apache-2.0 OR MIT
    tauri-plugin-fs         Apache-2.0 OR MIT
    serde                   Apache-2.0 OR MIT
    serde_json              Apache-2.0 OR MIT

The full transitive dependency set is recorded in
apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.lock, overwhelmingly Apache-2.0 OR MIT with a
small number of BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause and ISC entries.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
User interface and runtime (JavaScript/TypeScript)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    @tauri-apps/api                 Apache-2.0 OR MIT
    @tauri-apps/plugin-dialog       MIT OR Apache-2.0
    @tauri-apps/plugin-fs           MIT OR Apache-2.0
    three                           MIT
    @noble/hashes                   MIT
    svelte                          MIT

Svelte runtime helpers are included in the compiled interface. Its compiler,
Vite and TypeScript are build-time tooling and are not redistributed as tools.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Companion server (not part of the installer)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

apps/mcp runs from a source checkout and is not included in the installers. Its
runtime dependencies are:

    @modelcontextprotocol/sdk       MIT
    ws                              MIT
    zod                             MIT
    json-schema-typed               BSD-2-Clause

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Microsoft WebView2
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The application renders through the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, which is
NOT bundled or redistributed here — it ships with Windows 11 and is installed
separately on Windows 10. Its use is governed by Microsoft's own terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reproducing this list
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    pnpm licenses list --prod                 # JavaScript dependencies
    apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.lock         # exact Rust crate set and versions

Full license texts for each component are distributed inside the corresponding
package in node_modules and in the crate sources fetched by Cargo.

